47697098753","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1444532151039377411/V6WdmQXN_normal.jpg","text":"海外のお方に、日本の素敵な本を勧められました。素敵そうなの。これを読みながら、また純喫茶にいたいわね。\n\nコーヒーが冷めないうちに   川口俊和 \u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4763135074/ref=cm_sw_r_tw_awdb_imm_REJSHV7FDNBQGQS41EN3\u003e via \u003chttps://twitter.com/AmazonJP|@AmazonJP\u003e \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FBDXEAaUYAUxOXu.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FBDXEAaUYAUxOXu.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1633562478,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/u4Dgz/status/1445891947697098753?s=20","original_url":"https://twitter.com/u4Dgz/status/1445891947697098753?s=20"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5F0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d741747f-1c80-47f7-82ce-c6ab89f38773","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"酸味と甘味はバランスが大事","ts":"1633534286.048000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U022XK5866Q","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TLg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02cff916-d6a6-480c-bacd-367dd3f44e4d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"いつかどこか紹介してもらいたいものだ(首都圏在住じゃないので機会がない)","ts":"1633534207.046900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8oRgu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ddfd2db9-e26e-4cf2-8fe7-a93adec7f3ea","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"甘すぎて美味しくない冷凍ブドウをプレーンヨーグルトに突っ込んだらなかなか良い","ts":"1633534176.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"etaq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc30d0c9-d8ac-43f3-8d10-d66721e19233","type":"message","user":"U027UKB8YTW","text":"喫茶ニット様に行ってきました。とても上品な空間で素敵でした。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/u4Dgz/status/14456953065620